33
00:01:51.560 --> 00:01:51.973
Callarse la boca.

34
00:01:53.267 --> 00:01:55.026
Esta es la hija mayor de la familia Walker.

35
00:01:57.180 --> 00:01:57.814
Señorita Walker,

36
00:01:58.245 --> 00:02:00.280
